{"id":"5875","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5875_main_stratus-nebulosus-opacus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>层云通常是灰色云层，云底相当均匀，它可带来毛毛雨、雪或米雪。当透过层云可看到太阳（或月亮）时，其轮廓清晰可辨。在本图中，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云是均匀的灰色，没有可辨的形状</span>，因而可将其确定为薄幕云种。它还十分浓密且蔽光，无法看到太阳，可确定为蔽光云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"奥地利，维也纳，内城","latitude":"纬度: 48° 12' 23'' N","longitude":"经度: 16° 21' 50'' E","date":"13 October 2014 1227 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 6, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.8.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.8.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5875_syn_stratus-nebulosus-opacus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1200 UTC天气图显示出在欧洲西部上空和附近大西洋的一些低压中心。照片拍摄地（以红箭头标示）位于弱气压梯度和微风主导的区域内。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5875_upper_stratus-nebulosus-opacus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200 UTC在奥地利维也纳（WMO 11035）的探测显示出在950至900 hPa之间的近饱和层，上方是变弱的下沉逆温。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5031_main_stratus-sea-fog-and-cumulus_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>低 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层云</span>，可能是海面上的海雾，位于英国苏格兰西部奥本附近的利斯莫尔岛西岸。在北面的苏格兰大陆山脉上空较远的地方还能看着正在发展的 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中积云</span>。天空中还有一点 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Ian Simpson","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国苏格兰奥本","latitude":"纬度: 56° 28' 60'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 33' 0'' W","date":"03 August 2011 1000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.8.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.8.0"},{"src":"/images/compressed/6063_main_stratus-viewed-from-above_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>从香港的最高峰大帽山（957米）俯瞰，可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层云</span>。层云的上表面通常有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波浪</span>（通常是短波长），而且有时有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">凸起</span>。在强风下，波浪更加明显。</p>\n<p>在照片的顶部是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>层。云的大范围特征可确定为成层云种。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆形的大云团</span>很蔽光，可遮住太阳（蔽光云类）；然而，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">可看到从云素之间的间隙透过的光线</span>，这也表明是漏隙云类。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴暗浅蓝色的条纹和光束呈曙暮辉的形式</span>。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Francis So","location":"俯瞰层云","latitude":"纬度: 22° 24' 32'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 8' 16'' E","date":"07 February 2014 0804 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.8.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.8.0"}]}]}